    "body": "Now that we no longer need to work through our neovim/deps mirror, we can bump these Windows-only deps freely.\r\n\r\nThis updates libiconv to 1.18 so we are in sync with the Zig build (latest is 1.19, but allyourcodebase/libiconv is still at 1.18 https://github.com/allyourcodebase/libiconv/pull/2). I've added a note on that requirement to MAINTAIN.md.",
