            "body": "> D:\\a\\neovim\\neovim\\.deps\\build\\src\\libiconv-build\\srclib\\stddef.h(127): fatal error C1189: #error:  \"Please include config.h first.\"\r\n\r\n> D:\\a\\neovim\\neovim\\.deps\\build\\src\\libiconv-build\\config.h(2115): fatal error C1189: #error:  \"<stdbool.h> does not exist on this platform. Use gnulib module 'stdbool-c99' instead of gnulib module 'stdbool'.\"\r\n\r\nWat.",
